@WebApiDemo_HostAddress = http://localhost:5039

### Get all employees
GET {{WebApiDemo_HostAddress}}/api/employee
Accept: application/json

### Get all employees - V1
GET {{WebApiDemo_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Employee
Accept: application/json

###### Get employee by ID - V1
GET {{WebApiDemo_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Employee/7
Accept: application/json

### Get employee by ID - V1
GET {{WebApiDemo_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Employee/7
Accept: application/json

